{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T06:08:20.927Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9d7f970542d8df5a0a6bdb3b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1713+pm-gh1719+pm-o74zyh","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1713","claim:pm-gh1719","claim:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-o74zyh","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-chdp87"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"commitItemMutations cannot compensate a create that clears a collection: the explicit_unset suffix hides the apply marker, so a refused batch reports transaction_partial_mutation and keeps the create"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Found while implementing pm-gh1713 (2026-11-14). A strict-preset importer must pass the --clear-* options (clearDeps, clearComments and the rest) to satisfy strict create's required repeatables. When the create runs inside commitItemMutations, buildHistoryMessage appends ' | explicit_unset=dependencies,comments,...' to the transaction's apply marker. compensateCreatedItem and isUpdateMarkerApplied match the marker by exact string equality, so they never recognise the step's own create. When a later row fails, compensation therefore throws transaction_partial_mutation ('cannot safely compensate incomplete step'), the batch surfaces an AggregateError, and the created item stays open. Reproduced with no deferrals and with close validation off: a create step with clearDeps plus a failing update row. The same create without clear options rolls back cleanly. Fix: treat the marker as a prefix followed by ' | ' (isStepMarkerMessage) everywhere a step marker is matched. Duplicate check: searched compensation explicit_unset marker partial mutation; pm-wb6ktl covers guard-judged compensation, not marker matching."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:sdk","importers","strict-preset","transactions"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-14T06:08:20.927Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T06:08:20.927Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":45},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A commitItemMutations batch whose create step clears collections rolls back cleanly when a later row fails, with no transaction_partial_mutation; Marker matching accepts the explicit_unset suffix and nothing else; A spec reproduces the refusal and passes after the fix"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-9rgaal"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A refused batch rolls back its strict-mode creates"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Compensation refuses with transaction_partial_mutation and the created item stays open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-gh1713","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-11-14T06:08:20.927Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-wb6ktl","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-14T06:08:20.927Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"59eafef766743d2218470c299803465ed3ff7a022305a336cd47f5fb127538e2","item_hash_version":3,"message":"File compensation marker mismatch for creates with explicit clears","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"fbe6480a2d01259f54198bd69d69f920a36bb489c72f6a5b724892b591c95f7d"}
